  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7210810",
      "subQuestName": "（test）检测荒神社完成，通知group切suit$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721081001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721081001": {
            "id": "721081001",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "怎么了？你不是还要去吃那啥「神樱大福」吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081002"
            ]
          },
          "721081002": {
            "id": "721081002",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "快去吧。如果见到了那个臭狐狸，记得帮吾辈带个好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210801",
      "subQuestName": "寻找「奇怪的声音」的源头",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721080101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721080101": {
            "id": "721080101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "终于到了，这里就是镇守之森了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080102"
            ]
          },
          "721080102": {
            "id": "721080102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "面具巫女小姐说，她有一个老朋友在镇守之森的深处。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080103"
            ]
          },
          "721080103": {
            "id": "721080103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那我们就赶紧动身吧，往深处去！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210811",
      "subQuestName": "（test）黑屏派蒙说话$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210802",
      "subQuestName": "（test）第二段区域$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721080201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721080201": {
            "id": "721080201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "大狸猫",
            "text": "(test)谢谢捏！如果你不来我人就没了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080202"
            ]
          },
          "721080202": {
            "id": "721080202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(test)小事一桩",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080203"
            ]
          },
          "721080203": {
            "id": "721080203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "大狸猫",
            "text": "(test)我的本体就是这个雕像了，现在附在这个小狸猫上跟你说话。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080204"
            ]
          },
          "721080204": {
            "id": "721080204",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "大狸猫",
            "text": "(test)你有什么事情吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210812",
      "subQuestName": "（test）第3与4段区域$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721081201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721081201": {
            "id": "721081201",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "花散里",
            "text": "相当漂亮，无论是五百藏的障眼法，还是您击败妖物的手段。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081202"
            ]
          },
          "721081202": {
            "id": "721081202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「噫！」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081203"
            ]
          },
          "721081203": {
            "id": "721081203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…我本想这么说，但其实已经习惯了。面具巫女小姐可真没新意。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081204"
            ]
          },
          "721081204": {
            "id": "721081204",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "花散里",
            "text": "这样啊。让您失望了，非常抱歉。下次我会加油的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081205"
            ]
          },
          "721081205": {
            "id": "721081205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "别这种事情上加油…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081206"
            ]
          },
          "721081206": {
            "id": "721081206",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "花散里",
            "text": "说得也是。那么，五百藏…他是否还安好呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081208",
              "721081210"
            ]
          },
          "721081208": {
            "id": "721081208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "虽然变成了石头。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081211"
            ]
          },
          "721081211": {
            "id": "721081211",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "花散里",
            "text": "原来是这样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081212"
            ]
          },
          "721081212": {
            "id": "721081212",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "花散里",
            "text": "一般来说，妖狸作乱这种事情，只要不太过火，是不会派人去专门退治的。毕竟妖狸一族虽然顽皮，但心地善良单纯，和小孩子一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081213"
            ]
          },
          "721081213": {
            "id": "721081213",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "花散里",
            "text": "但是，连「大祓」所需的镇物也敢偷，那确实会受到惩罚呢。听你们的说法，既然是「影向役者三人组」，那多半是惟神…过去一名阴阳师下的手。"
          },
          "721081210": {
            "id": "721081210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "但很有精神呢！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210819",
      "subQuestName": "寻找「奇怪的声音」的源头",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
